  help: I am seeing two commas in a row. This is the second one! Just delete one of the
        commas and you should be all set!

        Note: If you are trying to define a record type across multiple lines, I
        recommend using this format:

            { name : string
            , age : int
            , value : 'a
            }

        Notice that each line starts with some indentation. Usually two or four spaces.
        This is the stylistic convention in the Nash ecosystem.
